@sasikala.malutty4173 Yes, of course and thank you for asking so respectfully. ❤

After coming to Pakistan during Partition, my grandfather first arrived in Lahore and later moved to Multan. Some time afterward, he remarried. My grandmother was also a refugee from the Amritsar area. She was from a village called Sultanwind and had also migrated to Pakistan during those painful years.

She was about five years younger than my grandfather. It was her first marriage, but for my grandfather, it was his second. From this marriage, they were blessed with nine children, and that is the family I come from.
